# Header bar

The window header bar is the title only. Never put buttons, spinners, labels, menus, or any other control in it.

Page actions sit on the page, in the page's own bar. That was rejected once, and the buttons had to be moved back. Do not do it again.

```vala
// Wrong. This is the window header.
this.window.content_header.pack_end(button);
header.pack_start(spinner);

// Right. A bar that belongs to the page.
var toolbar = new Gtk.Box(Gtk.Orientation.HORIZONTAL, 12);
toolbar.append(button);
this.append(toolbar);
```
